TITLE:: ExtendedTracker
summary:: Advanced tracking logic with complex-domain features.
categories:: Analysis, Pitch
related:: Classes/MultiF0Tracker

DESCRIPTION::
ExtendedTracker expands the capabilities of the basic MultiF0Tracker by incorporating complex-domain features and advanced statistical modeling. It is designed for high-fidelity analysis where phase information and subtle spectral nuances are critical.

THEORETICAL BACKGROUND::
ExtendedTracker uses the "Complex Phase Gradient" to refine frequency estimates beyond the resolution of the FFT bins. This technique, also known as the "Phase Vocoder" method, allows for sub-bin precision in pitch tracking.